` Gampil Flexible Loops and Conditionals Test `

bitOff algo[asc8()() args]:
    \ 1. Flexible else fallback
    num16 x be 10
    if x < 5:
        printf ["Less than 5\n"]
      but
    x < 8:
        printf ["Less than 8\n"]
      but
    else:
        printf ["Default fallback reached!\n"]
      but
    ok

    \ 2. Redo loop over table literal with dynamic let iterator
    redo {1, 2, 3} as let i:
        printf ["i = %d\n", i]
      ok

    \ 3. Multi-array and multi-variable loop
    num16(3) arr1 be {10, 20, 30}
    num16(3) arr2 be {100, 200, 300}
    redo arr1, arr2 as let val1, let val2:
        printf ["val1: %d, val2: %d\n", val1, val2]
      ok
ok
